---
import Page from '../../../components/Page.astro';
const BUY = 'https://shop.videogamepalooza.org/products/tornado-spinner-arcade-spinner-controller';
---
<Page title="Tornado Spinner" eyebrow="Arcade Parts"
  metaTitle="Tornado Spinner — Precision Arcade Spinner Control | DreamAuthentics"
  description="The Tornado Spinner: the world's first ultra-smooth custom arcade spinner for PCs and emulators. USB 2.0 16-bit, Energy Cylinder flyweight, PC or JAMMA. Made in the USA. Buy online for $96.79."
  blurb="The world's first ultra-smooth gaming spinner, custom made for retro gaming.">
  <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center">
    <img src="/img/controls/tornado-spinner.png" alt="Tornado Spinner precision arcade spinner"
      style="max-width:min(420px,90%);height:auto;margin:0 auto 24px" loading="eager" />
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7">An extremely smooth, effortless spin that is perfect for emulation
      and PC gaming &mdash; the one must-have part for any serious custom arcade or control panel. The first custom
      arcade spinner designed for use with PCs and emulators: not a repurposed part, but a spinner built for the job
      from the start.</p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:28px 0;text-align:left">
      <div><strong>PC or JAMMA</strong><br/><span style="color:var(--mut)">Works with a PC over USB, or with JAMMA boards through the TTL interface.</span></div>
      <div><strong>USB 2.0 &middot; 16-bit</strong><br/><span style="color:var(--mut)">Faster packet rate than USB 1.1 &mdash; vital for avoiding slowdown.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Energy Cylinder</strong><br/><span style="color:var(--mut)">A fly-weight that provides inertia, giving very long spin times.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Made in the USA</strong><br/><span style="color:var(--mut)">Designed and manufactured in the United States.</span></div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700">$96.79</p>
    <p style="margin:18px 0 8px">
      <a href={BUY} style="display:inline-block;color:#231a00;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold),#d99400);padding:12px 30px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;text-decoration:none">Buy Now &mdash; $96.79</a>
    </p>
    <p style="color:var(--mut);font-size:.95rem">Sold through the Video Game Palooza charity store &mdash; 100% of proceeds
      fund free tech training and living-wage careers. Also see <a href="https://www.tornadospinner.com">tornadospinner.com</a>
      or call <a href="tel:8007898424">800-789-8424</a>.</p>
    <img src="/img/controls/tornado-spinner-colours.png" alt="Tornado Spinner color options"
      style="max-width:min(520px,95%);height:auto;margin:26px auto 0" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
</Page>
